        "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "In this exquisite illustration, a mesmerizing nymph is depicted in the heart of an ancient forest. She sits gracefully atop a gnarled and weathered tree stump, adorned in flowing robes reminiscent of antiquity. Her long hair cascades around her like a shimmering waterfall, intertwined with leaves and petals that have fallen from the surrounding trees. The nymph's delicate features are highlighted by the dappled light filtering through the dense canopy above, casting an ethereal glow on her skin. Detailed branches and foliage surround her, creating a mystical environment filled with intricate details such as moss-covered roots, twisted vines, and lush ferns. The nymph's attire is a testament to the passing of time, featuring tattered fabrics that have been worn by countless generations before her, imbuing the scene with an air of mystery and magic.",
        "An intriguing and modern design is presented in an engaging isometric perspective. The subject matter remains flexible and can be tailored to fit various themes or subjects, ranging from architectural structures to detailed infographics to quirky character designs. This style offers a unique, flat yet three-dimensional visual presentation that creates depth and interest without the use of traditional shading techniques. The resulting image is both visually appealing and easy to understand, making it ideal for various applications such as web design, marketing materials, or educational content., Isometric_Setting"
      ],
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    },
